# Skill: screenshots-marketing

## Overview

This skill generates marketing screenshots using Playwright for web applications. It provides professional-quality screenshots optimized for marketing materials, documentation, and presentations.

## Capabilities

- **Marketing-Quality Screenshots**: Professional-grade screenshots with proper lighting and composition
- **Playwright Integration**: Uses Playwright for reliable browser automation
- **Responsive Capture**: Capture screenshots at various viewport sizes
- **Batch Processing**: Generate multiple screenshots in one run
- **Custom Styling**: Apply custom CSS/styling for marketing purposes
- **Output Formats**: Multiple output formats (PNG, JPEG, WebP)

## Use Cases

### Marketing
- Create hero images for landing pages
- Generate product showcase screenshots
- Create social media marketing assets

### Documentation
- Create documentation screenshots
- Generate feature showcase images

### Development
- Capture UI states for marketing review
- Generate consistent screenshots for A/B testing

## Example Usage

```
opencode run "Use screenshots-marketing to capture https://example.com at 1920x1080"

opencode run "Use screenshots-marketing to capture https://example.com at multiple breakpoints"

opencode run "Use screenshots-marketing to capture https://example.com with custom styling"
```

## Technical Details

This skill uses Playwright's browser automation capabilities to capture high-quality screenshots with proper rendering. It handles responsive design and can capture screenshots at various viewport sizes.

## Output

The skill provides:
- Screenshot files (PNG, JPEG, WebP)
- Multiple viewport sizes
- Optional custom styling
- Metadata for each capture

